{"id":"b82bf7f23ed43df1","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-truth-predicate.md","title":"Truth Predicate (Hypothetical)","display":"df-truth-predicate — Truth Predicate (Hypothetical)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-truth-predicate","aliases":["92-df-truth-predicate"],"display":"df-truth-predicate — Truth Predicate (Hypothetical)","depends_on":["[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-standard-model]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-substitution]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-truth-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-truth-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-predicate — Truth Predicate (Hypothetical)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(T\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (candidate truth formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (distinguished variable, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (free-variable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (substitution, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\\)</span> (external truth predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G(T,x)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(T)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(T,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},x))\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G(T,x)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(T)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(T,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},x))\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> : 假设的真谓词</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G(T,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(T,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},x)\\)</span>：把候选真公式应用于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>之Gödel数的正式对象语言实例</li>\n<li>Tarski不可定义性定理断言不存在满足该条件的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>-语言算术公式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>：完整算术真理码集不能在标准模型<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\)</span>中由一个算术公式定义</li>\n<li>该结论不排除对固定复杂度片段定义部分真谓词，也不排除在更强元语言中定义<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>的满足关系</li>\n<li>真比可证更强</li>\n<li>这是语义与语法的核心区分</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-standard-model","status":"resolved","id":"ccb738ae4bbf923c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-standard-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":fal